d","start":6},{"w":"parsing.","start":6.76}]},{"id":"c02","start":7.775,"end":15.38,"marks":{},"text":"Last time we learned what a dependency tree looks like. Today we see how a fast parser builds one, a single move at a time.","words":[{"w":"Last","start":7.775},{"w":"time","start":8.095},{"w":"we","start":8.335},{"w":"learned","start":8.495},{"w":"what","start":8.855},{"w":"a","start":9.015},{"w":"dependency","start":9.095},{"w":"tree","start":9.855},{"w":"looks","start":10.175},{"w":"like.","start":10.495},{"w":"Today","start":10.975},{"w":"we","start":11.455},{"w":"see","start":11.695},{"w":"how","start":11.935},{"w":"a","start":12.095},{"w":"fast","start":12.255},{"w":"parser","start":12.575},{"w":"builds","start":13.015},{"w":"one,","start":13.455},{"w":"a","start":13.775},{"w":"single","start":13.975},{"w":"move","start":14.415},{"w":"at","start":14.735},{"w":"a","start":14.895},{"w":"time.","start":15.055}]}],"title":"Welcome","shortTitle":"Welcome","props":{"kicker":"Unit 3 · Lesson 3","title":"Transition-Based Parsing","subtitle":"Building a tree one move at a time"},"start":0.6,"end":15.38,"startFrame":0,"durationInFrames":489},{"id":"idea","kind":"core","component":"BigIdea","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c03","start":16.3,"end":22.471,"marks":{},"text":"Here's the idea. Read the sentence from left to right, and build the tree using just a few simple moves.","words":[{"w":"Here's","start":16.3},{"w":"the","start":16.7},{"w":"idea.","start":16.86},{"w":"Read","start":17.5},{"w":"the","start":17.9},{"w":"sentence","start":18.06},{"w":"from","start":18.58},{"w":"left","start":18.78},{"w":"to","start":19.02},{"w":"right,","start":19.26},{"w":"and","start":19.58},{"w":"build","start":19.82},{"w":"the","start":20.14},{"w":"tree","start":20.26},{"w":"using","start":20.62},{"w":"just","start":20.94},{"w":"a","start":21.18},{"w":"few","start":21.3},{"w":"simple","start":21.58},{"w":"moves.","start":21.98}]}],"title":"The big idea","shortTitle":"The big idea","props":{"kicker":"Key idea","text":"Read left to right, and build the tree with a few simple moves.","highlight":["few simple moves."]},"start":16.3,"end":22.471,"startFrame":489,"durationInFrames":213},{"id":"parser","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c04","start":23.4,"end":32.32,"marks":{},"text":"A transition parser reads words from a queue called the buffer, keeps words it's still working on in a pile called the stack, and picks one move at each step.","words":[{"w":"A","start":23.4},{"w":"transition","start":23.56},{"w":"parser","start":24.16},{"w":"reads","start":24.68},{"w":"words","start":25.16},{"w":"from","start":25.44},{"w":"a","start":25.6},{"w":"queue","start":25.82},{"w":"called","start":26.04},{"w":"the","start":26.28},{"w":"buffer,","start":26.4},{"w":"keeps","start":27.04},{"w":"words","start":27.44},{"w":"it's","start":27.76},{"w":"still","start":28},{"w":"working","start":28.24},{"w":"on","start":28.56},{"w":"in","start":28.76},{"w":"a","start":28.92},{"w":"pile","start":29.04},{"w":"called","start":29.4},{"w":"the","start":29.68},{"w":"stack,","start":29.84},{"w":"and","start":30.28},{"w":"picks","start":30.52},{"w":"one","start":30.88},{"w":"move","start":31.16},{"w":"at","start":31.48},{"w":"each","start":31.64},{"w":"step.","start":31.92}]},{"id":"c05","start":32.72,"end":37.927,"marks":{},"text":"At any moment, you can describe where it is by what's on the stack and what's left in the buffer.","words":[{"w":"At","start":32.72},{"w":"any","start":32.92},{"w":"moment,","start":33.2},{"w":"you","start":33.76},{"w":"can","start":33.92},{"w":"describe","start":34.12},{"w":"where","start":34.68},{"w":"it","start":34.84},{"w":"is","start":35},{"w":"by","start":35.2},{"w":"what's","start":35.4},{"w":"on","start":35.76},{"w":"the","start":35.84},{"w":"stack","start":36},{"w":"and","start":36.4},{"w":"what's","start":36.64},{"w":"left","start":36.96},{"w":"in","start":37.2},{"w":"the","start":37.36},{"w":"buffer.","start":37.44}]},{"id":"c06","start":38.327,"end":46.829,"marks":{},"text":"Think of sorting post. New letters wait in your in-tray, that's the buffer, and letters you're still dealing with sit in a pile on your desk. That's the stack.","words":[{"w":"Think","start":38.327},{"w":"of","start":38.527},{"w":"sorting","start":38.687},{"w":"post.","start":39.207},{"w":"New","start":39.807},{"w":"letters","start":40.087},{"w":"wait","start":40.527},{"w":"in","start":40.767},{"w":"your","start":40.887},{"w":"in-tray,","start":41.207},{"w":"that's","start":41.527},{"w":"the","start":41.887},{"w":"buffer,","start":42.007},{"w":"and","start":42.487},{"w":"letters","start":42.647},{"w":"you're","start":43.047},{"w":"still","start":43.247},{"w":"dealing","start":43.447},{"w":"with","start":43.767},{"w":"sit","start":43.927},{"w":"in","start":44.207},{"w":"a","start":44.327},{"w":"pile","start":44.447},{"w":"on","start":44.807},{"w":"your","start":44.967},{"w":"desk.","start":45.167},{"w":"That's","start":45.767},{"w":"the","start":46.167},{"w":"stack.","start":46.367}]}],"title":"What is a transition parser?","shortTitle":"What is a transition parser?","props":{"kicker":"Definition","term":"Transition parser","definition":"Reads words from a buffer, keeps unfinished words on a stack, and picks one move at each step.","example":"stack: [ROOT, ate]  ·  buffer: [pizza]","analogy":"Sorting post: an in-tray of new letters, and a pile on your desk still being dealt with."},"start":23.4,"end":46.829,"startFrame":702,"durationInFrames":730},{"id":"moves","kind":"core","component":"Table","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c07","start":47.733,"end":51.478,"marks":{},"text":"The version in your syllabus is called arc-eager. It has four moves.","words":[{"w":"The","start":47.893},{"w":"version","start":48.053},{"w":"in","start":48.213},{"w":"your","start":48.293},{"w":"syllabus","start":48.453},{"w":"is","start":48.973},{"w":"called","start":49.173},{"w":"arc-eager.","start":49.733},{"w":"It","start":50.293},{"w":"has","start":50.493},{"w":"four","start":50.693},{"w":"moves.","start":50.973}]},{"id":"c08","start":51.878,"end":54.842,"marks":{},"text":"SHIFT pushes the next word from the buffer onto the stack.","words":[{"w":"SHIFT","start":51.878},{"w":"pushes","start":52.358},{"w":"the","start":52.758},{"w":"next","start":52.878},{"w":"word","start":53.198},{"w":"from","start":53.438},{"w":"the","start":53.558},{"w":"buffer","start":53.678},{"w":"onto","start":53.998},{"w":"the","start":54.318},{"w":"stack.","start":54.438}]},{"id":"c09","start":55.242,"end":62.066,"marks":{},"text":"LEFT-ARC makes the next word the head of the word on top of the stack, then pops that top word off. Its job is done.","words":[{"w":"LEFT-ARC","start":55.562},{"w":"makes","start":55.882},{"w":"the","start":56.162},{"w":"next","start":56.282},{"w":"word","start":56.562},{"w":"the","start":56.762},{"w":"head","start":56.922},{"w":"of","start":57.082},{"w":"the","start":57.162},{"w":"word","start":57.282},{"w":"on","start":57.522},{"w":"top","start":57.682},{"w":"of","start":57.962},{"w":"the","start":58.042},{"w":"stack,","start":58.202},{"w":"then","start":58.682},{"w":"pops","start":58.922},{"w":"that","start":59.362},{"w":"top","start":59.562},{"w":"word","start":59.922},{"w":"off.","start":60.282},{"w":"Its","start":60.722},{"w":"job","start":61.122},{"w":"is","start":61.482},{"w":"done.","start":61.722}]},{"id":"c10","start":62.466,"end":67.626,"marks":{},"text":"RIGHT-ARC makes the top word the head of the next word, then pushes the next word onto the stack.","words":[{"w":"RIGHT-ARC","start":62.806},{"w":"makes","start":63.146},{"w":"the","start":63.386},{"w":"top","start":63.546},{"w":"word","start":63.866},{"w":"the","start":64.106},{"w":"head","start":64.266},{"w":"of","start":64.426},{"w":"the","start":64.546},{"w":"next","start":64.666},{"w":"word,","start":65.026},{"w":"then","start":65.346},{"w":"pushes","start":65.626},{"w":"the","start":66.146},{"w":"next","start":66.266},{"w":"word","start":66.586},{"w":"onto","start":66.846},{"w":"the","start":67.106},{"w":"stack.","start":67.226}]},{"id":"c11","start":68.026,"end":72.433,"marks":{},"text":"And REDUCE pops the top word, once it has its head and all its dependents.","words":[{"w":"And","start":68.026},{"w":"REDUCE","start":68.186},{"w":"pops","start":68.706},{"w":"the","start":69.026},{"w":"top","start":69.186},{"w":"word,","start":69.506},{"w":"once","start":69.866},{"w":"it","start":70.186},{"w":"has","start":70.346},{"w":"its","start":70.546},{"w":"head","start":70.826},{"w":"and","start":71.066},{"w":"all","start":71.226},{"w":"its","start":71.466},{"w":"dependents.","start":71.706}]}],"title":"The four moves","shortTitle":"The four moves","props":{"kicker":"Arc-eager","title":"The four moves of arc-eager parsing","columns":["Move","What it does"],"rows":[["SHIFT","push the next word onto the stack"],["LEFT-ARC","next word heads the top word; pop it"],["RIGHT-ARC","top word heads the next word; push it"],["REDUCE","pop the top word: it's finished"]],"highlight":[]},"start":47.733,"end":72.433,"startFrame":1432,"durationInFrames":768},{"id":"walk","kind":"core","component":"Table","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c12","start":73.333,"end":78.976,"marks":{},"text":"Let's parse \"Priya ate pizza\". We start with ROOT on the stack, and all three words in the buffer.","words":[{"w":"Let's","start":73.333},{"w":"parse","start":73.693},{"w":"\"Priya","start":74.013},{"w":"ate","start":74.333},{"w":"pizza\".","start":74.653},{"w":"We","start":75.293},{"w":"start","start":75.613},{"w":"with","start":75.973},{"w":"ROOT","start":76.133},{"w":"on","start":76.493},{"w":"the","start":76.613},{"w":"stack,","start":76.733},{"w":"and","start":77.133},{"w":"all","start":77.373},{"w":"three","start":77.613},{"w":"words","start":77.933},{"w":"in","start":78.293},{"w":"the","start":78.373},{"w":"buffer.","start":78.493}]},{"id":"c13","start":79.376,"end":82.179,"marks":{},"text":"Step one, SHIFT: Priya moves onto the stack.","words":[{"w":"Step","start":79.376},{"w":"one,","start":79.776},{"w":"SHIFT:","start":80.056},{"w":"Priya","start":80.556},{"w":"moves","start":81.056},{"w":"onto","start":81.356},{"w":"the","start":81.656},{"w":"stack.","start":81.776}]},{"id":"c14","start":82.579,"end":89.214,"marks":{},"text":"Step two, LEFT-ARC: the next word, ate, becomes the head of Priya. Priya is the subject, so she's popped off.","words":[{"w":"Step","start":82.579},{"w":"two,","start":82.939},{"w":"LEFT-ARC:","start":83.479},{"w":"the","start":84.019},{"w":"next","start":84.179},{"w":"word,","start":84.579},{"w":"ate,","start":84.859},{"w":"becomes","start":85.139},{"w":"the","start":85.539},{"w":"head","start":85.699},{"w":"of","start":85.859},{"w":"Priya.","start":86.019},{"w":"Priya","start":86.599},{"w":"is","start":87.179},{"w":"the","start":87.339},{"w":"subject,","start":87.499},{"w":"so","start":88.019},{"w":"she's","start":88.179},{"w":"popped","start":88.539},{"w":"off.","start":88.899}]},{"id":"c15","start":89.614,"end":94.248,"marks":{},"text":"Step three, RIGHT-ARC: ROOT becomes the head of ate, and ate goes onto the stack.","words":[{"w":"Step","start":89.614},{"w":"three,","start":90.014},{"w":"RIGHT-ARC:","start":90.614},{"w":"ROOT","start":91.214},{"w":"becomes","start":91.574},{"w":"the","start":91.974},{"w":"head","start":92.134},{"w":"of","start":92.294},{"w":"ate,","start":92.494},{"w":"and","start":92.694},{"w":"ate","start":92.934},{"w":"goes","start":93.174},{"w":"onto","start":93.434},{"w":"the","start":93.694},{"w":"stack.","start":93.814}]},{"id":"c16","start":94.648,"end":101.522,"marks":{},"text":"Step four, RIGHT-ARC: ate becomes the head of pizza, the object. The buffer is empty, and the tree is complete.","words":[{"w":"Step","start":94.648},{"w":"four,","start":95.008},{"w":"RIGHT-ARC:","start":95.501},{"w":"ate","start":95.995},{"w":"becomes","start":96.488},{"w":"the","start":96.848},{"w":"head","start":96.968},{"w":"of","start":97.128},{"w":"pizza,","start":97.288},{"w":"the","start":97.808},{"w":"object.","start":98.008},{"w":"The","start":98.728},{"w":"buffer","start":98.968},{"w":"is","start":99.448},{"w":"empty,","start":99.608},{"w":"and","start":100.088},{"w":"the","start":100.248},{"w":"tree","start":100.408},{"w":"is","start":100.728},{"w":"complete.","start":100.968}]}],"title":"Parsing “Priya ate pizza”","shortTitle":"How a parser builds a sentence tree in 4 moves","props":{"kicker":"Worked example","title":"Parsing “Priya ate pizza”","columns":["Step","Move","Link added"],"rows":[["1","SHIFT","none: Priya goes on the stack"],["2","LEFT-ARC","ate → Priya (subject)"],["3","RIGHT-ARC","ROOT → ate"],["4","RIGHT-ARC","ate → pizza (object)"]],"highlight":[{"row":1,"col":2},{"row":3,"col":2}]},"start":73.333,"end":101.522,"startFrame":2200,"durationInFrames":873},{"id":"choose","kind":"core","component":"Steps","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c17","start":102.433,"end":105.615,"marks":{},"text":"But how does the parser know which move to make? Here's the loop.","words":[{"w":"But","start":102.433},{"w":"how","start":102.513},{"w":"does","start":102.673},{"w":"the","start":102.913},{"w":"parser","start":102.993},{"w":"know","start":103.433},{"w":"which","start":103.673},{"w":"move","start":103.873},{"w":"to","start":104.153},{"w":"make?","start":104.313},{"w":"Here's","start":104.673},{"w":"the","start":105.113},{"w":"loop.","start":105.233}]},{"id":"c18","start":106.015,"end":111.342,"marks":{},"text":"Look: check the word on top of the stack, the next words in the buffer, and the links made so far.","words":[{"w":"Look:","start":106.015},{"w":"check","start":106.335},{"w":"the","start":106.655},{"w":"word","start":106.855},{"w":"on","start":107.095},{"w":"top","start":107.255},{"w":"of","start":107.535},{"w":"the","start":107.615},{"w":"stack,","start":107.775},{"w":"the","start":108.175},{"w":"next","start":108.375},{"w":"words","start":108.735},{"w":"in","start":109.095},{"w":"the","start":109.215},{"w":"buffer,","start":109.295},{"w":"and","start":109.775},{"w":"the","start":110.002},{"w":"links","start":110.228},{"w":"made","start":110.455},{"w":"so","start":110.735},{"w":"far.","start":110.975}]},{"id":"c19","start":111.742,"end":115.589,"marks":{},"text":"Score: a trained classifier gives a score to each possible move.","words":[{"w":"Score:","start":111.742},{"w":"a","start":112.262},{"w":"trained","start":112.422},{"w":"classifier","start":112.822},{"w":"gives","start":113.582},{"w":"a","start":113.782},{"w":"score","start":113.902},{"w":"to","start":114.262},{"w":"each","start":114.422},{"w":"possible","start":114.702},{"w":"move.","start":115.262}]},{"id":"c20","start":115.989,"end":118,"marks":{},"text":"Act: make the move with the best score.","words":[{"w":"Act:","start":115.989},{"w":"make","start":116.389},{"w":"the","start":116.629},{"w":"move","start":116.789},{"w":"with","start":117.029},{"w":"the","start":117.149},{"w":"best","start":117.269},{"w":"score.","start":117.549}]},{"id":"c21","start":118.4,"end":121.062,"marks":{},"text":"Repeat: keep going until the buffer is empty.","words":[{"w":"Repeat:","start":118.4},{"w":"keep","start":118.96},{"w":"going","start":119.28},{"w":"until","start":119.64},{"w":"the","start":119.84},{"w":"buffer","start":119.96},{"w":"is","start":120.36},{"w":"empty.","start":120.56}]}],"title":"Choosing each move","shortTitle":"Choosing each move","props":{"kicker":"Inside the parser","title":"How the parser chooses each move","steps":[{"label":"Look","detail":"top of the stack, next words"},{"label":"Score","detail":"a classifier scores each move"},{"label":"Act","detail":"make the best-scoring move"},{"label":"Repeat","detail":"until the buffer is empty"}]},"start":102.433,"end":121.062,"startFrame":3073,"durationInFrames":586},{"id":"train","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c22","start":121.967,"end":123.947,"marks":{},"text":"And how is that classifier trained?","words":[{"w":"And","start":121.967},{"w":"how","start":122.127},{"w":"is","start":122.327},{"w":"that","start":122.527},{"w":"classifier","start":122.687},{"w":"trained?","start":123.487}]},{"id":"c23","start":124.347,"end":128.435,"marks":{},"text":"Start with a treebank: sentences whose correct trees are already known.","words":[{"w":"Start","start":124.347},{"w":"with","start":124.667},{"w":"a","start":124.827},{"w":"treebank:","start":125.267},{"w":"sentences","start":125.707},{"w":"whose","start":126.427},{"w":"correct","start":126.667},{"w":"trees","start":127.107},{"w":"are","start":127.427},{"w":"already","start":127.587},{"w":"known.","start":128.027}]},{"id":"c24","start":128.835,"end":135.662,"marks":{},"text":"For each one, work out the sequence of moves that would build that exact tree. The rule that does this is called the oracle.","words":[{"w":"For","start":128.835},{"w":"each","start":129.075},{"w":"one,","start":129.355},{"w":"work","start":129.675},{"w":"out","start":129.955},{"w":"the","start":130.115},{"w":"sequence","start":130.275},{"w":"of","start":130.675},{"w":"moves","start":130.835},{"w":"that","start":131.235},{"w":"would","start":131.355},{"w":"build","start":131.555},{"w":"that","start":131.835},{"w":"exact","start":132.075},{"w":"tree.","start":132.595},{"w":"The","start":133.075},{"w":"rule","start":133.355},{"w":"that","start":133.675},{"w":"does","start":133.875},{"w":"this","start":134.195},{"w":"is","start":134.435},{"w":"called","start":134.635},{"w":"the","start":134.955},{"w":"oracle.","start":135.115}]},{"id":"c25","start":136.062,"end":140.886,"marks":{},"text":"Then train a classifier to predict the oracle's move from what it sees at each step.","words":[{"w":"Then","start":136.062},{"w":"train","start":136.262},{"w":"a","start":136.582},{"w":"classifier","start":136.702},{"w":"to","start":137.462},{"w":"predict","start":137.662},{"w":"the","start":138.062},{"w":"oracle's","start":138.222},{"w":"move","start":138.782},{"w":"from","start":139.102},{"w":"what","start":139.302},{"w":"it","start":139.462},{"w":"sees","start":139.662},{"w":"at","start":140.022},{"w":"each","start":140.222},{"w":"step.","start":140.502}]}],"title":"How it learns","shortTitle":"How it learns","props":{"kicker":"Training","title":"How the move-chooser learns","items":[{"text":"Start with sentences whose trees are known"},{"text":"Work out the moves that build each tree: the oracle"},{"text":"Train a classifier to predict those moves"}],"numbered":false},"start":121.967,"end":140.886,"startFrame":3659,"durationInFrames":595},{"id":"pros","kind":"core","component":"Compare","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c26","start":141.8,"end":143.805,"marks":{},"text":"So what's good about it, and what isn't?","words":[{"w":"So","start":141.8},{"w":"what's","start":141.96},{"w":"good","start":142.28},{"w":"about","start":142.52},{"w":"it,","start":142.8},{"w":"and","start":142.92},{"w":"what","start":143.16},{"w":"isn't?","start":143.36}]},{"id":"c27","start":144.205,"end":152.934,"marks":{},"text":"Strengths: it makes one pass from left to right, using about two moves per word, so it's very fast. And it's easy to give the classifier new clues.","words":[{"w":"Strengths:","start":144.205},{"w":"it","start":144.765},{"w":"makes","start":144.965},{"w":"one","start":145.245},{"w":"pass","start":145.565},{"w":"from","start":145.845},{"w":"left","start":146.045},{"w":"to","start":146.285},{"w":"right,","start":146.485},{"w":"using","start":146.885},{"w":"about","start":147.285},{"w":"two","start":147.565},{"w":"moves","start":147.805},{"w":"per","start":148.205},{"w":"word,","start":148.405},{"w":"so","start":148.685},{"w":"it's","start":148.925},{"w":"very","start":149.245},{"w":"fast.","start":149.565},{"w":"And","start":150.085},{"w":"it's","start":150.325},{"w":"easy","start":150.685},{"w":"to","start":151.005},{"w":"give","start":151.165},{"w":"the","start":151.285},{"w":"classifier","start":151.445},{"w":"new","start":152.245},{"w":"clues.","start":152.445}]},{"id":"c28","start":153.334,"end":162.504,"marks":{},"text":"Limits: it never goes back, so an early mistake can't be undone. And the basic version can only build projective trees, the ones without crossing links.","words":[{"w":"Limits:","start":153.334},{"w":"it","start":153.894},{"w":"never","start":154.094},{"w":"goes","start":154.374},{"w":"back,","start":154.694},{"w":"so","start":154.934},{"w":"an","start":155.174},{"w":"early","start":155.334},{"w":"mistake","start":155.694},{"w":"can't","start":156.214},{"w":"be","start":156.534},{"w":"undone.","start":156.734},{"w":"And","start":157.414},{"w":"the","start":157.614},{"w":"basic","start":158.001},{"w":"version","start":158.387},{"w":"can","start":158.774},{"w":"only","start":158.974},{"w":"build","start":159.254},{"w":"projective","start":159.574},{"w":"trees,","start":160.214},{"w":"the","start":160.694},{"w":"ones","start":160.934},{"w":"without","start":161.254},{"w":"crossing","start":161.534},{"w":"links.","start":162.054}]}],"title":"Strengths and limits","shortTitle":"Strengths and limits","props":{"kicker":"Pros and cons","title":"Strengths and limits","columns":[{"title":"Strengths","items":["one pass, left to right","very fast: about two moves per word","easy to add new clues"],"tone":"good"},{"title":"Limits","items":["an early mistake can't be undone","the basic version builds only projective trees"],"tone":"bad"}],"verdict":{"text":"Fast, and accurate enough for most uses"}},"start":141.8,"end":162.504,"startFrame":4254,"durationInFrames":649},{"id":"quiz","kind":"quiz","component":"Quiz","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c29","start":163.433,"end":169.396,"marks":{},"text":"Quick quiz. In arc-eager parsing, which move puts the next word onto the stack without adding any link?","words":[{"w":"Quick","start":163.726},{"w":"quiz.","start":164.02},{"w":"In","start":164.313},{"w":"arc-eager","start":164.773},{"w":"parsing,","start":165.233},{"w":"which","start":165.913},{